{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ba29be494e573118","type":"text","text":"Caide wants an arm (not be a cripple)","x":-235,"y":-369,"width":250,"height":129,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"94a1ce61688114d7","type":"text","text":"Caide agrees to steal a ledger from the Minister’s office. \n\n","x":-235,"y":-120,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ff2a4f0364520d0b","type":"text","text":"Work diligently?\nToo slow.","x":-560,"y":-110,"width":250,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b0de8ff2e6e72b31","type":"text","text":"Ask Dan for money?\nHe won’t say it outright, and Dan implied he can’t anyway. Help is for the weak.","x":-560,"y":57,"width":250,"height":183,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"36af4e0d4e582e2c","type":"text","text":"Blackmail someone for money?\nCould be something. Maybe Dan is in on it.","x":-560,"y":300,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"788c17d04ff8b560","type":"text","text":"Steal?\nPossible. ","x":100,"y":-120,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b29c777765c1771b","type":"text","text":"Assassinate someone for money?\n\nNo, because he doesn’t want to draw his sword. \n","x":100,"y":60,"width":250,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a42face6fe65105c","type":"text","text":"Marry into royalty?\n\nFunny, but far-fetched.","x":-235,"y":89,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f33e31a101046d82","type":"text","text":"”The Apology“\n\n- Caide admits it was him\n- Not apologetic for doing it, only because it caused Dan harm\n- Dan hijacks his guilt and enlists him into his service","x":-200,"y":300,"width":492,"height":257},
		{"id":"40053f350ce8bc3a","type":"text","text":"Dan & Sigan’s dynamic\n\n- Dan feels unappreciated\n- Sigan sees him as a tool\n- Sigan strings him along with promises of making him a legitimate heir\n- Sigan has an elitist mindset. ","x":540,"y":-369,"width":440,"height":269,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"3581951cb4f0a27d","type":"text","text":"Sigan does something terrible","x":610,"y":-40,"width":300,"height":116},
		{"id":"3e17369688472485","type":"text","text":"He takes Dan’s woman after discovering their secret relationship","x":635,"y":144,"width":250,"height":131,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8a6b604ab8382be4","x":2800,"y":-369,"width":440,"height":329,"type":"text","text":"Dan and Sol’s dynamic:\n- Sol is Dan’s mirror–another dutiful son forced to do the whims of his father\n- While Sol wouldn’t resist, Dan leaves him no choice (He removves Sol’s father from the equation\n- "},
		{"id":"6ee11008f057849f","type":"text","text":"Calling out Caide for being ‘lazy’ and not being physically involved","x":1200,"y":275,"width":250,"height":117,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a863aff2cce9b8fd","type":"text","text":"Caide won’t reveal that he has only one hand","x":1200,"y":445,"width":250,"height":117},
		{"id":"14a9bd00549bc26d","type":"text","text":"He fights Batch so he doesn’t lose authority over the others","x":1200,"y":611,"width":250,"height":117},
		{"id":"1e5fa6b8a4a57e62","type":"text","text":"Caide and Batch’s dynamic\n- Dan instructed Batch to oppose Caide at every turn (Every hero needs a villain)\n- Batch gets to a point where he truly believes in what Caide is doing and doesn’t want to harrass him anymore","x":1420,"y":-369,"width":440,"height":329},
		{"id":"aa17306cb7021206","type":"text","text":"What is Batch’s angle of attack?","x":1200,"y":76,"width":250,"height":123},
		{"id":"2d557ad5f5099282","x":1610,"y":76,"width":250,"height":123,"type":"text","text":"What similarity could Caide and Batch share?"}
	],
